screen 1280 800 dpi 1.0
# U37: AddCustomModifierToDisplayItem on a rare body armour, where every source has mods (the
# source test loop of L3788-3796 keeps all ten, plus Custom). Crafting Bench: open the modifier
# dropdown and hover an entry (the tooltip: the mod lines and AddModComparisonTooltip through the
# calc), pick it, hover Add (addModifier through AddItemTooltip). Beastcraft, then the sort set
# to the second stat (applySort: getSortValue through calcFunc for every entry, the selection
# reset to the first entry), then Necropolis with that sort active (buildMods, SetSel(1),
# applySort(stat, true) on the new list), the sort back to Default, then Essence, Veiled,
# Fossil, Delve and Incursion drop-restricted, Prefix and Suffix (each list drawn open), then
# Custom (the modifier dropdown and the sort hidden, the edit box shown): type a line and Add
# (the custom line; SetDisplayItem, ClosePopup).
#! u37-expect display: U37 Plate, Glorious Plate
#! u37-expect Adding this mod will give
#! u37-expect ^7exp +12 to Strength U
fixture userdir=user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/u37_items.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
